        },
        {
          "text": "Yu ũkeeyũmban’ya nguthu nguthu, we mwĩĩtu wa nguthu; nũtũthyũlũlũkĩte atũtw’ĩkanĩsye; makakũna mũsili wa Isilaeli na ndata ĩtau.",
