        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ we, Mbethi‐leemu ya Evilatha, ũla wĩ mũnini ũtatalwa katĩ wa ngili sya Yuta, kwaku kũkauma ũmwe ambũkĩe ũla wĩtw’ĩka mũsumbĩki kwa Isilaeli; ũla kumĩla kwake nĩ kuma ĩvinda ya tene, kuma tene tene. ",
