        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu akaekana namo, kũvika ĩvinda yĩla ũla ũnũkwaũnya wĩĩthĩwa asyaĩte: nĩvo ĩndĩ ũtialo wa ana‐a‐ĩthe make wĩsyoka kwa ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
